        <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Full Refund</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Money back to original payment method</p>
