<!-- Policy Content -->
<section style="background: #000; padding: 100px 0;">
  <div class="container-lux" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px;">
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Our Return Promise</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">At LUXORA Jewelry, your complete satisfaction is our top priority. We understand that purchasing fine jewelry is a significant investment, and we want you to feel confident and delighted with every purchase.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">We offer a straightforward 30-day return policy to ensure you have ample time to fall in love with your jewelry. If for any reason you're not completely satisfied, we're here to make it right.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">30-Day Return Window</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">You have 30 days from the date you receive your order to initiate a return. This gives you plenty of time to try on your jewelry, show it to friends and family, and make sure it's the perfect piece for you.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">The 30-day period begins the day your package is delivered and signed for, not the day you placed your order.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Eligible Items for Return</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Items that can be returned:</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-left: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.8;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Unworn jewelry in original, pristine condition</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Items with all original tags, certificates, and documentation attached</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Products in their original packaging with all accessories included</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Jewelry that shows no signs of wear, damage, or alteration</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Items that cannot be returned:</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); line-height: 1.8;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Custom-made or bespoke jewelry designed specifically for you</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Engraved or personalized items</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Items showing signs of wear, damage, or resizing</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Earrings (for hygiene reasons)</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 8px;">Final sale or clearance items</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">How to Initiate a Return</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 24px 0; line-height: 1.8;">Follow these simple steps to start your return:</p>
      
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 20px; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.05); border-left: 3px solid #d4af37; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Step 1: Contact Us</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">Email support@luxorajewelry.com or call +1 (555) 123-4567 within 30 days of receiving your order. Provide your order number and reason for return.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 20px; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.05); border-left: 3px solid #d4af37; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Step 2: Receive Authorization</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">Our team will review your request and provide a Return Authorization (RA) number along with detailed return instructions within 24 hours.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 20px; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.05); border-left: 3px solid #d4af37; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Step 3: Package Securely</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">Place the item in its original packaging with all tags and certificates. Include a copy of your order confirmation and the RA number inside the package.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div style="padding: 20px; background: rgba(212,175,55,0.05); border-left: 3px solid #d4af37; border-radius: 8px;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Step 4: Ship It Back</p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin: 0; line-height: 1.7;">Ship the package using a trackable, insured shipping method to the address provided. We recommend signature confirmation for your protection.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Return Shipping Costs</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Standard Returns:</strong> Customers are responsible for return shipping costs unless the item is defective or we made an error with your order.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Defective or Incorrect Items:</strong> If you receive a defective item or we shipped the wrong product, we will cover all return shipping costs and send you a prepaid shipping label.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">We strongly recommend using insured shipping with tracking. LUXORA is not responsible for items lost or damaged during return shipment.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Refund Processing</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">Once we receive your return, our quality assurance team will inspect the item to ensure it meets our return criteria. This process typically takes 2-3 business days.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">If your return is approved, we will process your refund to the original payment method within 7-10 business days. You will receive an email confirmation when your refund has been processed.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">Please note that depending on your bank or credit card company, it may take an additional 5-7 business days for the refund to appear in your account.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Exchanges</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">While we don't offer direct exchanges, we're happy to help you find the perfect piece. Simply return your original item for a full refund and place a new order for the item you'd like instead.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">To ensure you get your preferred item quickly, we recommend placing your new order before shipping back your return. Once we receive and process your return, you'll receive your refund.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Damaged or Defective Items</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">We carefully inspect every piece before shipping, but if you receive a damaged or defective item, please contact us immediately—within 48 hours of delivery.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">We will arrange for a replacement or full refund at no cost to you, including return shipping. Please provide photos of the damage to expedite the process.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;">All LUXORA jewelry is covered by our limited lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #d4af37; margin: 0 0 16px 0; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);">Questions?</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 16px 0; line-height: 1.8;">Our customer care team is here to help with any questions about returns or exchanges.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 8px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Email:</strong> support@luxorajewelry.com</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0 0 8px 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Phone:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567</p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin: 0; line-height: 1.8;"><strong style="color: #d4af37;">Hours:</strong> Monday-Friday: 9AM-6PM EST | Saturday: 10AM-4PM EST</p>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>

